{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203390","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1320339001:1":{"text":"おじさま、この『未完成』という名前の絵が、レフスキーさんの最後の作品です。私たちで絵を修復しましたので、どうぞ受け取ってください。","source_cn":"大叔……这幅画是列夫斯基最后的作品，名叫《未完成》。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8255D9D6CF7A0F04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320339002:1":{"text":"そ、そんな……この絵はご友人が買われたのでしょう？","source_cn":"这……这怎么能行呢！你们花钱买下它，怎么能送给我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C5EC330765613A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320339003:1":{"text":"私が受け取るわけにはいきませんよ！","source_cn":"快快快，快收回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F29D65F77DCBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320339003":{"text":"私が受け取るわけにはいきませんよ！","source_cn":"快快快，快收回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F29D65F77DCBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320339005:1":{"text":"レフスキー……ああ、息子よ……うぅっ……","source_cn":"列夫斯基……唉，我可怜的儿子……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B1BFAEC417EACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn